Description: Provides R functions and command-line interfaces for malaria
    genomics analysis. Wraps existing specialised tools behind a consistent
    interface and shared TSV formats, and adds extra helpers such as naive
    complexity of infection (COI), allele frequency and prevalence estimators,
    filters, and format converters. Suitable for interactive use, scripting,
    or as a shared library in workflow pipelines. Thin wrappers do not install
    their specialised dependencies; those must be installed separately when
    needed.
